(3856266, 546901, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, but I don''t like the exposure.  It is too dark in some areas.  This is advanced editing so I think you could have processed a couple of times for better dynamic range.</td>', 'This is pretty cool, but I don''t like the exposure.  It is too dark in some areas.  This is advanced editing so I think you could have processed a couple of times for better dynamic range.', '2007-07-02 03:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856269, 546811, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but how does it relate to your weekend?  Did you go to Beavertail for a certain reason, other than to photograph this picture?  Was there a picnic?  I would have liked it better if the water reflected the sky, which is blown out, a little more.</td>', 'I like the picture, but how does it relate to your weekend?  Did you go to Beavertail for a certain reason, other than to photograph this picture?  Was there a picnic?  I would have liked it better if the water reflected the sky, which is blown out, a little more.', '2007-07-02 03:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856272, 546710, 63267, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, exposure looks good, colors look a bit red on the body and face, teeth could be whitebned a bit to give her a better beauty queen smile.  Overall there isn''t much on this photo that I like.</td>', 'Hmmm, exposure looks good, colors look a bit red on the body and face, teeth could be whitebned a bit to give her a better beauty queen smile.  Overall there isn''t much on this photo that I like.', '2007-07-02 03:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856274, 545630, 66515, '<td valign="top">The beach is awfully dark. Not that big of a deal but its such a large area in the shot. Cropping off some of the bottom would help. Aiming more to the right would have also helped.</td>', 'The beach is awfully dark. Not that big of a deal but its such a large area in the shot. Cropping off some of the bottom would help. Aiming more to the right would have also helped.', '2007-07-02 03:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856276, 546729, 63267, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the motion, but I think this has too much.  The face being frozen would have been better.  Ballparks are great for their lush green grass, I hate seeing it in black and white like this.  the uniform looks blown out losing all of the details of the wrinkles.  Overall, I just don''t care for this one too much.</td>', 'I can appreciate the motion, but I think this has too much.  The face being frozen would have been better.  Ballparks are great for their lush green grass, I hate seeing it in black and white like this.  the uniform looks blown out losing all of the details of the wrinkles.  Overall, I just don''t care for this one too much.', '2007-07-02 03:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856280, 546864, 63267, '<td valign="top">Good concept that is let down by bad focusing and too much.</td>', 'Good concept that is let down by bad focusing and too much.', '2007-07-02 03:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
