(3857941, 546301, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous shot. The expression is priceless, the background seperation is perfect, the composition definately strengthens the image. Lighting is very good. <br/> <br/>A couple of critiques, things I only mention because the overall image is so strong:<br/> <br/>Nose is slightly OOF. You likely know this. It does distract a touch. <br/> <br/>Eyes seems slightly milky - it''d be nice if the pupils were nice and black.<br/> <br/>The tuft of hair of the left side of his face is a little distracting. Maybe caused by the collar? You might be able to clone this out under Advanced rules, though it might make me nervous to do so. <br/> <br/>Great job. A 9 from me.</td>', 'This is a fabulous shot. The expression is priceless, the background seperation is perfect, the composition definately strengthens the image. Lighting is very good.  A couple of critiques, things I only mention because the overall image is so strong: Nose is slightly OOF. You likely know this. It does distract a touch.  Eyes seems slightly milky - it''d be nice if the pupils were nice and black. The tuft of hair of the left side of his face is a little distracting. Maybe caused by the collar? You might be able to clone this out under Advanced rules, though it might make me nervous to do so.  Great job. A 9 from me.', '2007-07-02 13:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857945, 546776, 76198, '<td valign="top">Very nice job! colors are great, bokeh is beautiful, though a touch more DOF might have been nice - the moth comes out a hair soft. <br/> <br/>Love the composition. Nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice job! colors are great, bokeh is beautiful, though a touch more DOF might have been nice - the moth comes out a hair soft.  Love the composition. Nice capture.', '2007-07-02 13:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857947, 545508, 70000, '<td valign="top">nice composition, i like how one of the people has a foot off the ground, it gives it more lift and motion</td>', 'nice composition, i like how one of the people has a foot off the ground, it gives it more lift and motion', '2007-07-02 13:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
