(3858035, 545136, 76198, '<td valign="top">This should be terrible, shouldn''t it? I mean, there''s no real subject, it''s cluttered, the woman is blurred... So why do I keep coming back to it? <br/> <br/>There''s something about this shot that''s great to me. It has a very ''authentic'' feel, whatever that means. Reminds me a bit of William Eggleston. <br/> <br/>I am distracted by the light not being pure white, and a touch by the perfect centering of the coke machine. <br/> <br/>Anyway, this shot''ll get killed in voting, but I think it''s great. So I''m upping my vote to an 8.</td>', 'This should be terrible, shouldn''t it? I mean, there''s no real subject, it''s cluttered, the woman is blurred... So why do I keep coming back to it?  There''s something about this shot that''s great to me. It has a very ''authentic'' feel, whatever that means. Reminds me a bit of William Eggleston.  I am distracted by the light not being pure white, and a touch by the perfect centering of the coke machine.  Anyway, this shot''ll get killed in voting, but I think it''s great. So I''m upping my vote to an 8.', '2007-07-02 14:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
