(3858542, 546757, 70000, '<td valign="top">the lighting is really strange here. it puts shaddows in uncomfortable places and blows out other areas. another note, spending time with a friend on the weekend says more outside in the yard with a chewtoy than with a black background and portrait lighting. you did a good job posing them together though. would have been even cooler if the dog had looked down  so there was more of a connection between the two</td>', 'the lighting is really strange here. it puts shaddows in uncomfortable places and blows out other areas. another note, spending time with a friend on the weekend says more outside in the yard with a chewtoy than with a black background and portrait lighting. you did a good job posing them together though. would have been even cooler if the dog had looked down  so there was more of a connection between the two', '2007-07-02 15:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3858553, 545009, 70000, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks way too overprocessed to me. Its clear that since teh sun was behind her you had to dodge her alot to get the detail, but because we expect shaddows there and instead get BRIGHT color it looks very unnatural when  playing in the park is a more natural thing to do....i dont knot if that makes sense but I would have liked to see this from the other side where the sun was on her or something</td>', 'The lighting looks way too overprocessed to me. Its clear that since teh sun was behind her you had to dodge her alot to get the detail, but because we expect shaddows there and instead get BRIGHT color it looks very unnatural when  playing in the park is a more natural thing to do....i dont knot if that makes sense but I would have liked to see this from the other side where the sun was on her or something', '2007-07-02 15:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
