(3858915, 544839, 66041, '<td valign="top">note  a bad photo.  But the trees look terrible (sorry).   Not sure if they were over-sharpened or jsut harsh sunlight.</td>', 'note  a bad photo.  But the trees look terrible (sorry).   Not sure if they were over-sharpened or jsut harsh sunlight.', '2007-07-02 16:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3858930, 546743, 66041, '<td valign="top">Julie Andrews would have killed herself on this hillside   :-)  Colors are a little sun-bleached though...</td>', 'Julie Andrews would have killed herself on this hillside   :-)  Colors are a little sun-bleached though...', '2007-07-02 16:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3858952, 546847, 73235, '<td valign="top">There could be said a lot about this picture. You''re sending controversial messages with it. FOr once the chair on the beach with only horizontal lines implies steaduness, no change. But then your exposure time freezes the motion of the waves. A longer exposure would have taken out the harshness of the waves and smoothened them, strengthening your composition. Of course then you had to use a tripod or other support to take the picture. Technically the waves are blown out, no detail visible. You have sensor dust (or water drops) - check the blue sky. I really like your composition and the colors.</td>', 'There could be said a lot about this picture. You''re sending controversial messages with it. FOr once the chair on the beach with only horizontal lines implies steaduness, no change. But then your exposure time freezes the motion of the waves. A longer exposure would have taken out the harshness of the waves and smoothened them, strengthening your composition. Of course then you had to use a tripod or other support to take the picture. Technically the waves are blown out, no detail visible. You have sensor dust (or water drops) - check the blue sky. I really like your composition and the colors.', '2007-07-02 16:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3858967, 546864, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice centered composition. I can''t make out with part of your photo is in focus.</td>', 'nice centered composition. I can''t make out with part of your photo is in focus.', '2007-07-02 16:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3858981, 546824, 66041, '<td valign="top">way cool!   hope you had a blast!</td>', 'way cool!   hope you had a blast!', '2007-07-02 16:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
