(3859521, 546695, 9906, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Give the other guy a wii and this would have been even bettter.  You are a bit blown out and it''s too bad your sky wasn''t a little more dramatic.<br/>TC</td>', 'Cute!  Give the other guy a wii and this would have been even bettter.  You are a bit blown out and it''s too bad your sky wasn''t a little more dramatic.TC', '2007-07-02 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859523, 546082, 48680, '<td valign="top">lol :-)</td>', 'lol :-)', '2007-07-02 18:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859525, 546405, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Is that the reflection or did you shoot through the glass?<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Is that the reflection or did you shoot through the glass?TC', '2007-07-02 18:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859531, 545140, 48680, '<td valign="top">do like this, &amp; perfect title :)</td>', 'do like this, & perfect title :)', '2007-07-02 18:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859539, 546904, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your focus is a little too shallow.  I don''t know about the blown out white fuzziness on the left of the frame.  Your black background has enough detail in it to be distracting.  If you are gonna do a studio set up type shot like this you need to get all the details just right.  After all you get to shoot it over and over again.  It is digital!  ;-)<br/>TC</td>', 'Your focus is a little too shallow.  I don''t know about the blown out white fuzziness on the left of the frame.  Your black background has enough detail in it to be distracting.  If you are gonna do a studio set up type shot like this you need to get all the details just right.  After all you get to shoot it over and over again.  It is digital!  ;-)TC', '2007-07-02 18:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859554, 546352, 9906, '<td valign="top">Kinda dull.  It might have been better if it wasn''t shot at such a harsh sunlite time of day.<br/>TC</td>', 'Kinda dull.  It might have been better if it wasn''t shot at such a harsh sunlite time of day.TC', '2007-07-02 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859563, 546474, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  I think I would like to have seen the garage in it''s entirety though.  This looks a little awkward on the left of the frame...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice scene.  I think I would like to have seen the garage in it''s entirety though.  This looks a little awkward on the left of the frame...TC', '2007-07-02 18:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859599, 544515, 9906, '<td valign="top">The underexposure here really detracts from the shot.  Trouble is, I don''t have any idea how I would go about exposing this properly.  I''m sure the ducks and swans were not about to cooperate and hold a pose for 2 or 3 seconds...<br/>TC</td>', 'The underexposure here really detracts from the shot.  Trouble is, I don''t have any idea how I would go about exposing this properly.  I''m sure the ducks and swans were not about to cooperate and hold a pose for 2 or 3 seconds...TC', '2007-07-02 18:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859617, 546392, 9906, '<td valign="top">Is this someone from the show?  I have never even seen an episode.  I don''t have HBO...  Nicely lit shot but I''m not sure if the black shirt on black background works here...<br/>TC</td>', 'Is this someone from the show?  I have never even seen an episode.  I don''t have HBO...  Nicely lit shot but I''m not sure if the black shirt on black background works here...TC', '2007-07-02 18:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859623, 545730, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on your choice to have the dog in focus and not the person...  It''s a cool look but seems just a touch odd in that perspective...  Great exposure in a tough lighting situation!<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m torn on your choice to have the dog in focus and not the person...  It''s a cool look but seems just a touch odd in that perspective...  Great exposure in a tough lighting situation!TC', '2007-07-02 18:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859645, 545071, 51386, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and idea. I think the shadows here are quite harsh though. It looks like you used a flash here? I would try and go for a less extreme angle with the lighting. Perhaps shooting with less frontal lighting would have really benefited this shot.</td>', 'Interesting colors and idea. I think the shadows here are quite harsh though. It looks like you used a flash here? I would try and go for a less extreme angle with the lighting. Perhaps shooting with less frontal lighting would have really benefited this shot.', '2007-07-02 18:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859649, 546902, 51386, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. Fun image!</td>', 'I like this idea. Fun image!', '2007-07-02 18:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859660, 546586, 32345, '<td valign="top">Nice pet portrait but it looks like it has been over processed for noise reduction</td>', 'Nice pet portrait but it looks like it has been over processed for noise reduction', '2007-07-02 18:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859664, 546318, 51386, '<td valign="top">BUSTED!! At least they didnt smile for the camera ;) Nice photo</td>', 'BUSTED!! At least they didnt smile for the camera ;) Nice photo', '2007-07-02 18:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859674, 546654, 51386, '<td valign="top">I wish you could have gotten a couple meters/feet higher for this one. It looks like the photo would have had an interesting flow if it wasnt cut off by that gray roof at the bottom.</td>', 'I wish you could have gotten a couple meters/feet higher for this one. It looks like the photo would have had an interesting flow if it wasnt cut off by that gray roof at the bottom.', '2007-07-02 18:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859692, 543049, 51386, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t recommend cropping a photo of a person in a spot like this. I once read an article (may have been a tutorial on DPC), that said cropping a human model at any joint such as wrists, knees and in this case neck, causes a subconscious thought of dismemberment, and truncates the flow of an image. Hope that doesnt sound too harsh, but I hope it helps :)</td>', 'I wouldn''t recommend cropping a photo of a person in a spot like this. I once read an article (may have been a tutorial on DPC), that said cropping a human model at any joint such as wrists, knees and in this case neck, causes a subconscious thought of dismemberment, and truncates the flow of an image. Hope that doesnt sound too harsh, but I hope it helps :)', '2007-07-02 18:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859697, 546352, 51386, '<td valign="top">Not a bad weekend task! Looks great! Is this in Germany? I kinda recognize the architecture...</td>', 'Not a bad weekend task! Looks great! Is this in Germany? I kinda recognize the architecture...', '2007-07-02 18:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859699, 546862, 51386, '<td valign="top">cool action shot! Like the wide angle effect</td>', 'cool action shot! Like the wide angle effect', '2007-07-02 18:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859707, 546874, 51386, '<td valign="top">TORONTO, eh?</td>', 'TORONTO, eh?', '2007-07-02 18:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859711, 545762, 51386, '<td valign="top">OHHH CRAP!!! <br/> <br/>Sweet action shot. Looks like it might turn out to be quite painful! Perfect DOF!</td>', 'OHHH CRAP!!!  Sweet action shot. Looks like it might turn out to be quite painful! Perfect DOF!', '2007-07-02 18:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859731, 546435, 51386, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, great idea! I like the story the photo tells. It seems like the flash properly exposed the paper, and underexposed the man. Frontal flash, especially the built in ones  tend to do that to shots. Id try retaking this shot, and playing with the lighting a little. (if you dont have any external flashes, go with a cheap worklight or office light reflected off a white board to fill his face, and you will be amazed at the difference)</td>', 'Hahaha, great idea! I like the story the photo tells. It seems like the flash properly exposed the paper, and underexposed the man. Frontal flash, especially the built in ones  tend to do that to shots. Id try retaking this shot, and playing with the lighting a little. (if you dont have any external flashes, go with a cheap worklight or office light reflected off a white board to fill his face, and you will be amazed at the difference)', '2007-07-02 18:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859732, 546238, 51386, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great weekend. Beautiful image</td>', 'Looks like a great weekend. Beautiful image', '2007-07-02 18:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3859738, 545473, 51386, '<td valign="top">Most of the image is much too dark. It would be interesting to see this as two merged exposures, cause the sky looks great.</td>', 'Most of the image is much too dark. It would be interesting to see this as two merged exposures, cause the sky looks great.', '2007-07-02 18:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
