(3860555, 546905, 9906, '<td valign="top">Two things I think take away from a potentially great shot.  Fist is the ''polaroid'' frame that you put on it (uneven at top and bottom) and the second is the lack of fishing line.  I can kind of see it going up the rod but don''t really see it going into the water.  Being translucent like fishing line is, I don''t have any pointers into how to make it show up.<br/>TC</td>', 'Two things I think take away from a potentially great shot.  Fist is the ''polaroid'' frame that you put on it (uneven at top and bottom) and the second is the lack of fishing line.  I can kind of see it going up the rod but don''t really see it going into the water.  Being translucent like fishing line is, I don''t have any pointers into how to make it show up.TC', '2007-07-02 21:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3860557, 546659, 9906, '<td valign="top">Alaska?  You need to do some tone mapping or play around with levels/curves to really make this pop.  I would love to play with the original after the challenge to see what I can do with it if you don''t mind...<br/>TC</td>', 'Alaska?  You need to do some tone mapping or play around with levels/curves to really make this pop.  I would love to play with the original after the challenge to see what I can do with it if you don''t mind...TC', '2007-07-02 21:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3860572, 546588, 63267, '<td valign="top">How does this relate to your weekend?  I see shoehorn, and DNMC=1<br/> <br/>edit,<br/>This is one where I still struggle with raising my vote.  Did you go snorkeling?  Maybe.  How can I tell though?  What this looks like to me is a man snorkeling in his studio.  the white background makes this shot look staged and therefore I can''t say you went snorkeling.  It looks like you pur your gear on, and took a studio photo.<br/> <br/>Overall this is very creative.  I am curious about the fish in the mask and how it was done.  the highkey works with the image, it just doesn''t convey your weekend to me.  If I didn''t feel this was a DNMC I would hve voted it an 8 easily.  I like it.<br/> <br/>However, I am still having a problem coming to grips with how it meets the challenge.  If I loosely say well the title doesn''t matter he went snorkeling, then it fits.  But I think in this challenge and for this image the title matters.  I am raising my original DNMC=1 to 5.  I would have gone higher if I didn''t think the title lets this image down, if only in the context of this challenge.  Had this been a free study the title would have fit perfectly.  But not in this challenge, in my opinion.  And I have to vote based on my opinion.</td>', 'How does this relate to your weekend?  I see shoehorn, and DNMC=1 edit,This is one where I still struggle with raising my vote.  Did you go snorkeling?  Maybe.  How can I tell though?  What this looks like to me is a man snorkeling in his studio.  the white background makes this shot look staged and therefore I can''t say you went snorkeling.  It looks like you pur your gear on, and took a studio photo. Overall this is very creative.  I am curious about the fish in the mask and how it was done.  the highkey works with the image, it just doesn''t convey your weekend to me.  If I didn''t feel this was a DNMC I would hve voted it an 8 easily.  I like it. However, I am still having a problem coming to grips with how it meets the challenge.  If I loosely say well the title doesn''t matter he went snorkeling, then it fits.  But I think in this challenge and for this image the title matters.  I am raising my original DNMC=1 to 5.  I would have gone higher if I didn''t think the title lets this image down, if only in the context of this challenge.  Had this been a free study the title would have fit perfectly.  But not in this challenge, in my opinion.  And I have to vote based on my opinion.', '2007-07-02 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
