(3860591, 546331, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great use of rule of thirds with this one.  Your border is a bit distracting though.  May wanna try this next time.  In between the white and the picture itself, place a one pixel black border.  It helps to keep the eye inside the frame and seperates the frame from the shot.  And instead of white, try selecting a color from inside the frame.  It can really accentuate the tones of the shot.  Remember overall presentation is what seperates a ribboner from a top twenty...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great use of rule of thirds with this one.  Your border is a bit distracting though.  May wanna try this next time.  In between the white and the picture itself, place a one pixel black border.  It helps to keep the eye inside the frame and seperates the frame from the shot.  And instead of white, try selecting a color from inside the frame.  It can really accentuate the tones of the shot.  Remember overall presentation is what seperates a ribboner from a top twenty...TC', '2007-07-02 22:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
