(3863946, 546896, 70000, '<td valign="top">The oversharpening would have worked REALLY well here if you had burned in the negative space because there is a halo around everything the rest of the photo just looks really washed out. I would love to see the negative space darkened out because you have a really fabulous candid photo here, everyone is so excited and wild and then there is one beautiful girl just staring up and she looks so happy. the texture in the performer''s clothing is wonderful and i just think this has a LOT of potential :-D</td>', 'The oversharpening would have worked REALLY well here if you had burned in the negative space because there is a halo around everything the rest of the photo just looks really washed out. I would love to see the negative space darkened out because you have a really fabulous candid photo here, everyone is so excited and wild and then there is one beautiful girl just staring up and she looks so happy. the texture in the performer''s clothing is wonderful and i just think this has a LOT of potential :-D', '2007-07-03 17:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3863947, 546734, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Looks a little overexposed.  Did you use the on camera flash?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute!  Looks a little overexposed.  Did you use the on camera flash?TC', '2007-07-03 17:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
