(3867296, 546893, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if a better use of ''Rule of Thirds'' would help - the lines are kinda cool without an exact use. For me, it''s a little out of focus. That cart in the background would have been nice if it were gone. I really like the reflection on the floor. Hope you had a nice trip!</td>', 'I''m not sure if a better use of ''Rule of Thirds'' would help - the lines are kinda cool without an exact use. For me, it''s a little out of focus. That cart in the background would have been nice if it were gone. I really like the reflection on the floor. Hope you had a nice trip!', '2007-07-04 12:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
