(3870795, 544637, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well you''ve really brought out the colours of the sky here. I''m guessing this took some doing in post (but it must have been a great sunset to start with). Really like the composition. There appears to be some weird halo''ing of some kind at the top of the inland water, but that might just have occurred in the resizing. Still, very nice. 8.</td>', 'Well you''ve really brought out the colours of the sky here. I''m guessing this took some doing in post (but it must have been a great sunset to start with). Really like the composition. There appears to be some weird halo''ing of some kind at the top of the inland water, but that might just have occurred in the resizing. Still, very nice. 8.', '2007-07-05 11:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
