(3870824, 546901, 23458, '<td valign="top">Amazing sky, beautiful light, and adventure sports tend to do well here. A winning formula indeed (I smell top ten!). Were it not for the dark corner at the bottom left you would have scored a 9 or ten from me. As it is you''ll have to settle for an 8. <br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Amazing sky, beautiful light, and adventure sports tend to do well here. A winning formula indeed (I smell top ten!). Were it not for the dark corner at the bottom left you would have scored a 9 or ten from me. As it is you''ll have to settle for an 8.  Well done.', '2007-07-05 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
