(3885082, 546333, 42100, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this is only a 5.4, it''s a great photograph!  Just wanted to tell you I liked it.  At any rate, keep up your great creativity and originality!</td>', 'Not sure why this is only a 5.4, it''s a great photograph!  Just wanted to tell you I liked it.  At any rate, keep up your great creativity and originality!', '2007-07-09 09:56:03.000000', NULL, 0),
