(3885192, 546475, 66597, '<td valign="top">I actually really like the business here. I didn''t vote in this challenge (I usually don''t when one of my photos is doing very well, as I''m afraid of impartiality) but would have given it a good score. The contrast is also very well done IMO. I love bw with lots of contrast.</td>', 'I actually really like the business here. I didn''t vote in this challenge (I usually don''t when one of my photos is doing very well, as I''m afraid of impartiality) but would have given it a good score. The contrast is also very well done IMO. I love bw with lots of contrast.', '2007-07-09 10:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
