(3885243, 546864, 61651, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the soft focus on this one, I think it''s appropriate - wouldn''t you be a bit bleary-eyed after staring at the TV all day? ;)  The graininess goes well, too.</td>', 'I don''t mind the soft focus on this one, I think it''s appropriate - wouldn''t you be a bit bleary-eyed after staring at the TV all day? ;)  The graininess goes well, too.', '2007-07-09 11:00:06.000000', NULL, 0),
