(3885407, 546589, 70514, '<td valign="top">It''s funny to me how tiny she looks in comparison to the other drivers, yet she''s not backing down to them! Very proud moment I''m sure... Now, when you start teaching her how to drive, send the pics!!!<br/> <br/>Great composition and lovely contrasting colors.  And great capture of her intense concentration!</td>', 'It''s funny to me how tiny she looks in comparison to the other drivers, yet she''s not backing down to them! Very proud moment I''m sure... Now, when you start teaching her how to drive, send the pics!!! Great composition and lovely contrasting colors.  And great capture of her intense concentration!', '2007-07-09 11:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885477, 546475, 41047, '<td valign="top">i love the rich blacks in this. very nice processing, deb.</td>', 'i love the rich blacks in this. very nice processing, deb.', '2007-07-09 12:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885490, 546333, 41047, '<td valign="top">i love the dof and the focus on the sea in this. very nice one, lisa.</td>', 'i love the dof and the focus on the sea in this. very nice one, lisa.', '2007-07-09 12:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885530, 546558, 70888, '<td valign="top">yes,unfortunately touching the nest or moving it is what killed them ive seen it happen before,after being touched by humans the adults stop feeding them,its strange behavior indeed but at least you can remember the experience with this great shot,i too was hoping to get a similar shot but something else found my little friends before i could get back with my camera...</td>', 'yes,unfortunately touching the nest or moving it is what killed them ive seen it happen before,after being touched by humans the adults stop feeding them,its strange behavior indeed but at least you can remember the experience with this great shot,i too was hoping to get a similar shot but something else found my little friends before i could get back with my camera...', '2007-07-09 12:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885551, 546495, 11769, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful moment in time. Almost like a memory, which someday it will be. Fantastic photo.</td>', 'What a wonderful moment in time. Almost like a memory, which someday it will be. Fantastic photo.', '2007-07-09 12:23:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885571, 546824, 11769, '<td valign="top">Congrats on second. That little balloon floating out over the city puts the perfect touch to an impeccable image.</td>', 'Congrats on second. That little balloon floating out over the city puts the perfect touch to an impeccable image.', '2007-07-09 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 0),
