(3885706, 546824, 36382, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice collection of pretty ribbons you are getting. :)  Congrats.</td>', 'That''s a nice collection of pretty ribbons you are getting. :)  Congrats.', '2007-07-09 12:52:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885709, 546668, 32345, '<td valign="top">Congrats for a very good finish, I did add it to my Fav during the voting period.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Congrats for a very good finish, I did add it to my Fav during the voting period. Well done.', '2007-07-09 12:52:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885723, 546638, 11467, '<td valign="top">Ha only 47th, after all that work!!!<br/>Amazing how it came out!</td>', 'Ha only 47th, after all that work!!!Amazing how it came out!', '2007-07-09 12:56:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885742, 546891, 52115, '<td valign="top">This was at a 4th-of-July party, had a fire in the evening. I gues he didn''t need the birdhouse. No birds were hurt or evicted in this shooting. How can a shot of fire be cool?<br/> <br/>Per someone''s suggestions I "Burned" the fire in PS3, but I forgot to set it to highlights, which inadveertently made it a duller fire.<br/> <br/>I''m greatly thankful for all the comments.</td>', 'This was at a 4th-of-July party, had a fire in the evening. I gues he didn''t need the birdhouse. No birds were hurt or evicted in this shooting. How can a shot of fire be cool? Per someone''s suggestions I "Burned" the fire in PS3, but I forgot to set it to highlights, which inadveertently made it a duller fire. I''m greatly thankful for all the comments.', '2007-07-09 13:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885780, 546475, 62318, '<td valign="top">It is a busy photo, but given that there is a ton of interest in the shot. I think there are too many open/empty shots these days, I think it is nice to see something fill the frame especially candids. I like it.</td>', 'It is a busy photo, but given that there is a ton of interest in the shot. I think there are too many open/empty shots these days, I think it is nice to see something fill the frame especially candids. I like it.', '2007-07-09 13:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885806, 546495, 50695, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on taking such a beautiful shot all the way to the blue ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations on taking such a beautiful shot all the way to the blue ribbon.', '2007-07-09 13:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885821, 546862, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate sports shots, I hate car shots, but I love a good photo. This would have gotten a high score from me. I feel the tension, the speed, the necessity of the pit crew in a way that I would never feel from watching it on tv.</td>', 'I hate sports shots, I hate car shots, but I love a good photo. This would have gotten a high score from me. I feel the tension, the speed, the necessity of the pit crew in a way that I would never feel from watching it on tv.', '2007-07-09 13:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885826, 546651, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why 21 photos are above this one.</td>', 'I have no idea why 21 photos are above this one.', '2007-07-09 13:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885837, 546482, 50695, '<td valign="top">dammit when we have our re-wedding I want you to be the photographer.</td>', 'dammit when we have our re-wedding I want you to be the photographer.', '2007-07-09 13:23:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885848, 546668, 40797, '<td valign="top">Great capature!!! Your personal best- Congratulations!!!!</td>', 'Great capature!!! Your personal best- Congratulations!!!!', '2007-07-09 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885851, 546748, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and composition. The little touches really propel this shot (flower, green grass).You always take amazing wildlife photos, and this one is no exception. Big congrats.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and composition. The little touches really propel this shot (flower, green grass).You always take amazing wildlife photos, and this one is no exception. Big congrats.', '2007-07-09 13:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885862, 544797, 50695, '<td valign="top">This looked so beautiful to me, the rich greens of Eden, even the black looks green, and your daughter is just a study of reds and pinks... but then I saw that apple (which I believe is out of focus, not "blown out") and I realized that I was unable to see the individual toothmarks. I don''t understand. How could you do this? How can I possibly enjoy this image without seeing the toothmarks? Have you no photographic decency? Must I now buy an apple and bite it myself? Once again, you have betrayed DPC with your blind devotion to <i>mood</i> and <i>tone</i> and <i>spirit</i>.</td>', 'This looked so beautiful to me, the rich greens of Eden, even the black looks green, and your daughter is just a study of reds and pinks... but then I saw that apple (which I believe is out of focus, not "blown out") and I realized that I was unable to see the individual toothmarks. I don''t understand. How could you do this? How can I possibly enjoy this image without seeing the toothmarks? Have you no photographic decency? Must I now buy an apple and bite it myself? Once again, you have betrayed DPC with your blind devotion to mood and tone and spirit.', '2007-07-09 13:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885864, 546495, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b&amp;w. Unusual to take the color out of the sunset, but it certainly worked well for you here. Congratulations on your blue ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful b&w. Unusual to take the color out of the sunset, but it certainly worked well for you here. Congratulations on your blue ribbon.', '2007-07-09 13:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885872, 546381, 50695, '<td valign="top">I came to DPC when you''d already grown into a DPC ribbon-winning photographer. I am now honored to watch as you grow beyond DPC.</td>', 'I came to DPC when you''d already grown into a DPC ribbon-winning photographer. I am now honored to watch as you grow beyond DPC.', '2007-07-09 13:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885884, 546415, 50695, '<td valign="top">No 10s?? That''s because I didn''t vote.</td>', 'No 10s?? That''s because I didn''t vote.', '2007-07-09 13:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3885889, 546386, 50695, '<td valign="top">stunning.</td>', 'stunning.', '2007-07-09 13:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
