(3885966, 545363, 62318, '<td valign="top">Fun action shot. Wonderful color and details. While I like the overall compositional elements, maybe perhaps a different stroke pose? Just a thought. Still wonderful shot and it looks like a lot of fun.</td>', 'Fun action shot. Wonderful color and details. While I like the overall compositional elements, maybe perhaps a different stroke pose? Just a thought. Still wonderful shot and it looks like a lot of fun.', '2007-07-09 14:03:42.000000', NULL, 0),
