(3886368, 546495, 11613, '<td valign="top">Wow what a great way to ruin a sunset. Take the color out of it. But fear not, thanks to all the pretentious knuckleheads that would rate a picture of dung with high marks if it were B&amp;W, you''ve scored a ribbon. WTG! Congrats on figuring out how to win the popularity contest among these wacky voters. Now if only you''d run for president to give the economy a boost by giving the comedians some more material for the next 4-8 years we''d be set.<br/> <br/>Oh I''m kidding! Seriously nice work. I would never have thought to desat a sunset but it works.<br/> <br/>I guess,<br/> <br/>To each his own.<br/> <br/>Sincerely,<br/> <br/>HeadKnucklehead.<br/> <br/>That should have been my username. HeadKnucklehead. It''s like H2O, only it''d be H2K. Unlike Y2K, actually a real disaster waiting to happen.<br/> <br/>Yours Truly,<br/>H2K</td>', 'Wow what a great way to ruin a sunset. Take the color out of it. But fear not, thanks to all the pretentious knuckleheads that would rate a picture of dung with high marks if it were B&W, you''ve scored a ribbon. WTG! Congrats on figuring out how to win the popularity contest among these wacky voters. Now if only you''d run for president to give the economy a boost by giving the comedians some more material for the next 4-8 years we''d be set. Oh I''m kidding! Seriously nice work. I would never have thought to desat a sunset but it works. I guess, To each his own. Sincerely, HeadKnucklehead. That should have been my username. HeadKnucklehead. It''s like H2O, only it''d be H2K. Unlike Y2K, actually a real disaster waiting to happen. Yours Truly,H2K', '2007-07-09 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
