le will never be appreciated on DPC as it does not fit the mould of advertising look images that often win or at least score well here.   she has won a ribbon, she knows what it takes to score well here. but you''re right, many ''outside the box'' masterpieces go unnoticed during voting. thank god for the posthumous ribbon thread. for the record, i gave this a 6.   haha.  thanks guys for the comments.  and ya... the ribbon i won just so happens to be one of my least favorite entries, evvvver!! :)  go figure~', '2007-07-20 22:38:11.000000', NULL, 0),
